    "summary": {
      "en": "New Winter Veil Music on Patch 12.1.7 PTR References \"Winter Veil Mini-Game\"...",
      "es": "La nueva música del Festival del Velo Invernal del PTR del parche 12.1.7 hace referencia al «minijuego del Festival del Velo Invernal»..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b0096ecd605f5.76635681\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">New Winter Veil music has been added to the Patch 12.1.7 PTR. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-winter-veil-mount-and-rewards-coming-with-patch-12-1-7-383451\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Winter Veil Updates for 2026</span></a></div><br><br>Winter Veil is coming with updates in Patch 12.1.7, including a new mount (<a data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=287092\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\">(Item #287092)</a>), pet, and decor! In addition, a new music file has been added for Winter Veil, and this file references a new <b>Winter Veil Mini-Game</b>.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TtrkfEIC7vw/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>While we can't know for sure what the mini-game might be yet, it could likely be related to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-winter-veil-neighborhood-activities-updates-in-patch-12-1-7-383562\" data-contiguous=\"true\">new Neighborhood activities</a> that are likely coming with this holiday season.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>New Winter Veil music has been added to the Patch 12.1.7 PTR. <br /><br />Winter Veil Updates for 2026<br /><br />Winter Veil is coming with updates in Patch 12.1.7, including a new mount (<a href=\"/item=287092/winterrrgls-pine-powered-candy-cane-contraption\">Winterrrgl's Pine-Powered Candy Cane Contraption</a>), pet, and decor! In addition, a new music file has been added for Winter Veil, and this file references a new <b>Winter Veil Mini-Game</b>.<br /><br />While we can't know for sure what the mini-game might be yet, it could likely be related to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-winter-veil-neighborhood-activities-updates-in-patch-12-1-7-383562\">new Neighborhood activities</a> that are likely coming with this holiday season.</noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56179-new-winter-veil-music-on-patch-12-1-7-ptr-references-winter-veil-mini-game.jpg",
