    "title": {
      "en": "Ret Paladin Bug Fix and Seed Hybridizer Available Again - WoW: Forever Hotfixes for November 19th",
      "es": "Corrección de errores del paladín Reprensión y vuelta del Hibridizador de semillas: correcciones inmediatas de WoW: Forever del 19 de noviembre"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Ret Paladin Bug Fix and Seed Hybridizer Available Again - WoW: Forever Hotfixes for November 19th...",
      "es": "Corrección de errores del paladín Reprensión e Hibridizador de semillas disponible de nuevo: correcciones inmediatas de WoW: Forever del 19 de noviembre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b00962b2b17e1.41884384\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes a Ret Paladin bug fix and making the Seed Hybridizer available again!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"hotfixes\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><hr><b>November 19, 2026</b><br><br><b>Camping</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Seed Hybridizer has been re-enabled.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Seed Hybridization now has adjusted values, as well as a chance of failure when combining seeds.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Scarce Herb Seeds are no longer able to be used in the Seed Hybridizer.</div></li></ul><b>Classes</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Paladin</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Retribution</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Two-Handed Weapon Specialization now correctly increases all Holy Damage you deal while a two-handed weapon is equipped.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Dungeons</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>City of Dalaran</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Shade of the Archmage should no longer despawn immediately upon entering combat.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>The Shaper’s Terrace</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Vitrix’s Poison Shock now deals less damage.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Enemies and NPCs</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Shimmering Flats - Fixed a Silithid Hive Drone that would stuck under the world near the Rustmaul Dig Site.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Riverglades – Fixed a bug preventing Mosh’gra’s from ever dropping rare loot.</div></li></ul><b>Items</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Motes of Unstable Magic are now soulbound.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Squall-breaker’s Potion can now be deleted.</div></li></ul><b>Quests</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Booty Bay - Rix Xizzix should no longer incorrectly provide access to a strange tome after completing the quest “Rift Away”.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Alterac Mountains - Fixed an issue where players could not obtain a new Ensorcelled Parchment while on the quest “Stormpike’s Deciphering” if destroyed from their inventory.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Resolved an issue with “Hunting for Ectoplasm” quest where the wrong creature type was used to gather ectoplasm.</div></li></ul><b>Races</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Skyborne</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue preventing the Skyborne from being able to receive the Honored reputation 10% gold discount on their Apprentice and Journeyman Riding skills sold by Genn Fairweather on Zephras Isle.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Tauren</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Cultivation should now succeed more reliably when used on herbs you have the Herbalism skill for.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed a bug that prevented Cultivation from working correctly with Purple Lotus.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><hr></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes a Ret Paladin bug fix and making the Seed Hybridizer available again!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><br /><b>November 19, 2026</b><br /><br /><b>Camping</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Seed Hybridizer has been re-enabled.</li><li>Seed Hybridization now has adjusted values, as well as a chance of failure when combining seeds.</li><li>Scarce Herb Seeds are no longer able to be used in the Seed Hybridizer.</li></ul><br /><b>Classes</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Paladin</b><br /><br /> <b>Retribution</b><br /><br /> Two-Handed Weapon Specialization now correctly increases all Holy Damage you deal while a two-handed weapon is equipped.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Dungeons</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>City of Dalaran</b><br /><br /> Shade of the Archmage should no longer despawn immediately upon entering combat.</li></ul><br /> <b>The Shaper’s Terrace</b><br /> <ul><li>Vitrix’s Poison Shock now deals less damage.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Enemies and NPCs</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Shimmering Flats - Fixed a Silithid Hive Drone that would stuck under the world near the Rustmaul Dig Site.</li><li>Riverglades – Fixed a bug preventing Mosh’gra’s from ever dropping rare loot.</li></ul><br /><b>Items</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Motes of Unstable Magic are now soulbound.</li><li>Squall-breaker’s Potion can now be deleted.</li></ul><br /><b>Quests</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Booty Bay - Rix Xizzix should no longer incorrectly provide access to a strange tome after completing the quest “Rift Away”.</li><li>Alterac Mountains - Fixed an issue where players could not obtain a new Ensorcelled Parchment while on the quest “Stormpike’s Deciphering” if destroyed from their inventory.</li><li>Resolved an issue with “Hunting for Ectoplasm” quest where the wrong creature type was used to gather ectoplasm.</li></ul><br /><b>Races</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Skyborne</b><br /><br /> Fixed an issue preventing the Skyborne from being able to receive the Honored reputation 10% gold discount on their Apprentice and Journeyman Riding skills sold by Genn Fairweather on Zephras Isle.</li></ul><br /> <b>Tauren</b><br /> <ul><li>Cultivation should now succeed more reliably when used on herbs you have the Herbalism skill for.</li><li>Fixed a bug that prevented Cultivation from working correctly with Purple Lotus.</li></ul><br /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
